The door is open.
The threshold is high.
The suitcase is very heavy!
But now the suitcase is in the hallway.
It is completely dark here.
Where is the switch?
The wall is cold.
Is the switch here?
Yes, there is the switch!
Now there is light.
I am in the apartment.
It is small, but it is nice.
Here is a living room.
There is a sofa and a table.
It is a furnished home.
The suitcase is on the floor.
I am very tired.
But I am also happy.
I am in Copenhagen!
